// handleStartDeploymentRequest handles startDeployment operation.
//
// The release (from `image`, or an existing `release`), the configuration revision and the run are
// written in one transaction with the audit record and the message to the executors; then the call
// answers `202` with the run's `Location`. Replaying the request with the same `Idempotency-Key`
